  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom into a vibrant sports haven with this custom basketball sports bedding. Perfect for basketball players and enthusiasts, this comforter features a dynamic collage of players and hoops, making it a standout addition to any sports-themed room. Personalize it with a custom name and number to create a unique, thoughtful gift for athletes, kids, or sports fans of all ages on birthdays, holidays, or special occasions.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Custom options allow you to add a specific name and number directly onto the product layout for a truly unique bedding piece.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Cozy &amp; Lightweight Feel:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester fabric with whole-piece microfiber filling that is soft, durable, and resists clumping.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Vibrant Printing:</strong> Utilizes specialized environmental protection manufacturing processes that help fabric hold onto dye and prevent fading over time.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from standard US bedding sizes including Twin (68\" x 88\"), Full (78\" x 88\"), Queen (88\" x 88\"), and King (104\" x 88\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care Instructions:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; dry quickly on low heat or let air dry without heat to maintain its fluffy loft.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton/ Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Basketball Players and Hoops Collage</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Personalized, Number, Sports</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All Seasons</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine wash with cold water; Tumble dry on low heat.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
